<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Multi-Stop Sequence Analysis</h2>
        <p>
            The Route Optimization module removes the guesswork from delivery planning. Using 
            advanced OSRM (Open Source Routing Machine) engine, the system calculates the 
            most efficient sequence for multi-stop runs, accounting for distance, time, and 
            local road connectivity. By optimizing the "Traveling Salesperson" challenge for 
            every trip, our software directly reduces fuel consumption and vehicle 
            maintenance requirements.
        </p>
        <p>
            Alternative routes are suggested automatically on detection of major road blockages 
            or significant traffic congestion, keeping your fleet moving toward its 
            targets.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Driver-Facing Turn-by-Turn Data</h2>
        <p>
            Optimized routes are perfectly synchronized with the driver's mobile application. Drivers 
            receive a logically sequenced manifest accompanied by turn-by-turn navigation data 
            tailored for professional vehicles. This digital guidance eliminates navigation 
            errors, reduces driver stress, and ensures that even new drivers can perform 
            at professional productivity levels from their first day.
        </p>
        <p>
            Planned vs. Actual route comparisons highlight deviations from authorized paths, 
            providing data for driver coaching and operational policy enforcement.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Traffic and Environmental Awareness</h2>
        <p>
            Design routes with awareness of local constraints. Account for varying bridge heights, 
            vehicle weight limits, and urban time-restrictions during the planning phase. 
            This technical integrity prevents dangerous navigation errors and ensures that 
            your routes are as practical as they are efficient, protecting your assets 
            and ensuring the safety of your personnel.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

